	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.Name = `01. Service & Organisation Message & Temporality-Note01ServiceMessage`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.Identifier = `ref_models.Note01ServiceMessage`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.Body = `01. Service & Organisation Message & Temporality Story

An [models.AIXMBasicMessage] groups aviation authorities, ATC units, and services via [models.BasicMessageMemberAIXMPropertyType].
Each feature ([models.OrganisationAuthorityType], [models.AirTrafficControlServiceType]) follows the AIXM Temporality Model
using [models.OrganisationAuthorityTimeSliceType] slices bounded by ValidTime ([models.TimePrimitivePropertyType]).
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.BodyHTML = `<p>01. Service &amp; Organisation Message &amp; Temporality Story
<p>An <a href="/models#AIXMBasicMessage">models.AIXMBasicMessage</a> groups aviation authorities, ATC units, and services via <a href="/models#BasicMessageMemberAIXMPropertyType">models.BasicMessageMemberAIXMPropertyType</a>.
Each feature (<a href="/models#OrganisationAuthorityType">models.OrganisationAuthorityType</a>, <a href="/models#AirTrafficControlServiceType">models.AirTrafficControlServiceType</a>) follows the AIXM Temporality Model
using <a href="/models#OrganisationAuthorityTimeSliceType">models.OrganisationAuthorityTimeSliceType</a> slices bounded by ValidTime (<a href="/models#TimePrimitivePropertyType">models.TimePrimitivePropertyType</a>).
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.X = 40.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.Y = 20.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.Width = 640.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.Height = 142.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.IsHidden = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.Matched = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.IsExpanded = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.Name = `02. OrganisationAuthority & ContactInformation-Note02OrganisationAuthority`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.Identifier = `ref_models.Note02OrganisationAuthority`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.Body = `02. OrganisationAuthority & ContactInformation Story

[models.OrganisationAuthorityTimeSliceType] represents states, civil aviation authorities, ANSPs, or airlines.
Inter-organisation relationships use [models.OrganisationAuthorityAssociationType], while reachability is modeled via
[models.ContactInformationType] ([models.PostalAddressType], [models.TelephoneContactType], and [models.OnlineContactType]).
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.BodyHTML = `<p>02. OrganisationAuthority &amp; ContactInformation Story
<p><a href="/models#OrganisationAuthorityTimeSliceType">models.OrganisationAuthorityTimeSliceType</a> represents states, civil aviation authorities, ANSPs, or airlines.
Inter-organisation relationships use <a href="/models#OrganisationAuthorityAssociationType">models.OrganisationAuthorityAssociationType</a>, while reachability is modeled via
<a href="/models#ContactInformationType">models.ContactInformationType</a> (<a href="/models#PostalAddressType">models.PostalAddressType</a>, <a href="/models#TelephoneContactType">models.TelephoneContactType</a>, and <a href="/models#OnlineContactType">models.OnlineContactType</a>).
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.X = 40.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.Y = 20.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.Width = 640.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.Height = 142.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.IsHidden = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.Matched = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.IsExpanded = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000002_.Name = `03. Unit, Availability & Dependency-Note03Unit`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000002_.Identifier = `ref_models.Note03Unit`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000002_.Body = `03. Unit, Availability & Dependency Story

A [models.UnitTimeSliceType] models an operational ATS unit (ACC, APP, TWR, FIC, ARO, or MET office).
Its operational hours are given by [models.UnitAvailabilityType], inter-unit delegation by [models.UnitDependencyType], and contact details by [models.ContactInformationType].
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000002_.BodyHTML = `<p>03. Unit, Availability &amp; Dependency Story
<p>A <a href="/models#UnitTimeSliceType">models.UnitTimeSliceType</a> models an operational ATS unit (ACC, APP, TWR, FIC, ARO, or MET office).
Its operational hours are given by <a href="/models#UnitAvailabilityType">models.UnitAvailabilityType</a>, inter-unit delegation by <a href="/models#UnitDependencyType">models.UnitDependencyType</a>, and contact details by <a href="/models#ContactInformationType">models.ContactInformationType</a>.
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000002_.X = 40.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000002_.Y = 20.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000002_.Width = 640.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000002_.Height = 106.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000002_.IsHidden = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000002_.Matched = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000002_.IsExpanded = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000003_.Name = `04. Traffic Separation Services (ATC, ATM, Ground)-Note04TrafficSeparation`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000003_.Identifier = `ref_models.Note04TrafficSeparation`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000003_.Body = `04. Traffic Separation Services (ATC, ATM, Ground) Story

Air traffic control services ([models.AirTrafficControlServiceTimeSliceType], [models.AirTrafficManagementServiceTimeSliceType], and
[models.GroundTrafficControlServiceTimeSliceType]) link an operational unit to the airspace or airport served and track status via [models.ServiceOperationalStatusType].
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000003_.BodyHTML = `<p>04. Traffic Separation Services (ATC, ATM, Ground) Story
<p>Air traffic control services (<a href="/models#AirTrafficControlServiceTimeSliceType">models.AirTrafficControlServiceTimeSliceType</a>, <a href="/models#AirTrafficManagementServiceTimeSliceType">models.AirTrafficManagementServiceTimeSliceType</a>, and
<a href="/models#GroundTrafficControlServiceTimeSliceType">models.GroundTrafficControlServiceTimeSliceType</a>) link an operational unit to the airspace or airport served and track status via <a href="/models#ServiceOperationalStatusType">models.ServiceOperationalStatusType</a>.
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000003_.X = 40.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000003_.Y = 20.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000003_.Width = 640.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000003_.Height = 124.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000003_.IsHidden = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000003_.Matched = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000003_.IsExpanded = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000004_.Name = `05. Information & SearchRescue Services-Note05InformationSAR`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000004_.Identifier = `ref_models.Note05InformationSAR`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000004_.Body = `05. Information & SearchRescue Services Story

[models.InformationServiceTimeSliceType] (FIS, ATIS, AFIS, VOLMET) and [models.SearchRescueServiceTimeSliceType] (RCC/RSC)
provide flight information and alerting/SAR coverage with real-time availability tracked in [models.ServiceOperationalStatusType].
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000004_.BodyHTML = `<p>05. Information &amp; SearchRescue Services Story
<p><a href="/models#InformationServiceTimeSliceType">models.InformationServiceTimeSliceType</a> (FIS, ATIS, AFIS, VOLMET) and <a href="/models#SearchRescueServiceTimeSliceType">models.SearchRescueServiceTimeSliceType</a> (RCC/RSC)
provide flight information and alerting/SAR coverage with real-time availability tracked in <a href="/models#ServiceOperationalStatusType">models.ServiceOperationalStatusType</a>.
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000004_.X = 40.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000004_.Y = 20.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000004_.Width = 640.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000004_.Height = 124.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000004_.IsHidden = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000004_.Matched = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000004_.IsExpanded = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000005_.Name = `06. Airport Ground Services & Supplies-Note06AirportGroundServices`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000005_.Identifier = `ref_models.Note06AirportGroundServices`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000005_.Body = `06. Airport Ground Services & Supplies Story

Aerodrome ground handling is modeled by [models.AircraftGroundServiceTimeSliceType] (de-icing, hangars), [models.AirportClearanceServiceTimeSliceType] (customs),
[models.FireFightingServiceTimeSliceType] (RFF category), and [models.AirportSuppliesServiceTimeSliceType] ([models.FuelType], [models.OilType], [models.OxygenType]).
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000005_.BodyHTML = `<p>06. Airport Ground Services &amp; Supplies Story
<p>Aerodrome ground handling is modeled by <a href="/models#AircraftGroundServiceTimeSliceType">models.AircraftGroundServiceTimeSliceType</a> (de-icing, hangars), <a href="/models#AirportClearanceServiceTimeSliceType">models.AirportClearanceServiceTimeSliceType</a> (customs),
<a href="/models#FireFightingServiceTimeSliceType">models.FireFightingServiceTimeSliceType</a> (RFF category), and <a href="/models#AirportSuppliesServiceTimeSliceType">models.AirportSuppliesServiceTimeSliceType</a> (<a href="/models#FuelType">models.FuelType</a>, <a href="/models#OilType">models.OilType</a>, <a href="/models#OxygenType">models.OxygenType</a>).
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000005_.X = 40.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000005_.Y = 20.000000
